{"1473260":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Black Gold: Oil Drilling Simulator","steam_appid":1473260,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/car?t=1792414442\" \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9d056774cfbb77d6ad742b7f2926d75c.avif?t=1792414442\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras_big\/9d056774cfbb77d6ad742b7f2926d75c.webp?t=1792414442 width=1560 height=521 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Huge content update 1.1.0 is LIVE! 🛢️<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Buildings &amp; Progression<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added five purchasable town buildings, each with unique benefits:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Church<\/strong> – Generates passive income through donations from residents.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mansion<\/strong> – Unlocks new player skills to learn.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop<\/strong> – Unlocks level 7 derrick upgrades, vehicle construction, and additional lumberjack aerocopters.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bank<\/strong> – Unlocks government contracts with two requirements to fulfill.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saloon<\/strong> – Unlocks optional night shifts for workers. Enabling night shifts doubles their wages.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added four new super skills.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added an outro sequence for completing the game.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Events &amp; World<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a daily newspaper system introducing random events that can affect gameplay. Check the newspaper by your house to find out what’s happening.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added map markers for events taking place in the game world.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extended the duration of both day and night.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles, Workers &amp; Automation<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a new drivable vehicle for travelling and transporting goods.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added an Unstuck option for the vehicle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added an automatic vehicle-calling option to the oil tank board.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added two additional lumberjack aerocopters.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added worker support for oil machines at electric derricks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The oil truck can now collect oil from two oil tanks.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls &amp; UI<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added dynamic control prompts for keyboard and two types of gamepads, including matching controller button icons.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More UI panels can now be closed with ESC.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added new animations for selected UI panels, opening the map, and the New Tutorial and New Journal Page notifications.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made the Unstuck button more visible.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made various minor UI improvements.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue, Tutorials &amp; Localization<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added new dialogue and voice-over when picking up journal pages.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added two new tutorials.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrected translations in multiple languages.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusted numerous text blocks to prevent clipping in localized text.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrected inaccurate descriptions for several items.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bug Fixes<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed an issue that prevented interaction with contracts in certain areas of the contracts panel.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed item-throw calculations running when throwing was unavailable.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed an issue where the furnace fire could disappear despite fuel still being available.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed various minor physics issues with held objects.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed an issue with oil sound playback.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/23c8f40b026cacf11bbfcb1a209a5faa.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1200 height=423 \/><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Oil Rush<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Gold: Oil Drilling Simulator puts you right in the muddy boots of a pioneer chasing the ultimate fortune. This is a first-person management game where success isn't handed to you it’s built with sweat, grease, and raw ambition. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/a9322164a182054e92b18b22c1712563.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/a9322164a182054e92b18b22c1712563.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/a9322164a182054e92b18b22c1712563.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve an Empire from the Dirt<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t just buy an oil rig; you build it. Start by clearing the land, chopping timber, and processing the materials needed to erect your very first derricks. Every plank laid and structure raised is a direct result of your hard labor. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/4df98e6610c469c7e769b209ed2a0f2c.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/4df98e6610c469c7e769b209ed2a0f2c.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/4df98e6610c469c7e769b209ed2a0f2c.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grease, Rust, and Roaring Engines<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machinery is the beating heart of your operation, but these iron beasts need constant babysitting. Listen to the rhythm of the pumps, replace grinding gears, and fight off the ever-present rust. If you don't maintain your equipment, the elements will gladly take it back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/257d800119ce2cf7d46c0738862653af.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/257d800119ce2cf7d46c0738862653af.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/257d800119ce2cf7d46c0738862653af.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Crew, Your Lifeline<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't drain the earth dry on your own. Hire a rugged crew to handle the heavy lifting. Train your workers to boost efficiency, and don't forget to upgrade your home base. Better living conditions mean higher morale, unlocking new ways to streamline your growing business. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9c880dd62a4fdb23e3d2cd32239add67.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9c880dd62a4fdb23e3d2cd32239add67.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9c880dd62a4fdb23e3d2cd32239add67.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strike It Rich<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling that first barrel of crude changes everything. Watch your funds skyrocket and immediately reinvest. Research early 1900s tech, expand your drilling territory, and replace rusty valves with industrial marvels. The race for wealth is unforgiving, but the payoff is legendary.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Oil Rush<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Gold: Oil Drilling Simulator puts you right in the muddy boots of a pioneer chasing the ultimate fortune. This is a first-person management game where success isn't handed to you it’s built with sweat, grease, and raw ambition. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/a9322164a182054e92b18b22c1712563.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/a9322164a182054e92b18b22c1712563.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/a9322164a182054e92b18b22c1712563.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve an Empire from the Dirt<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t just buy an oil rig; you build it. Start by clearing the land, chopping timber, and processing the materials needed to erect your very first derricks. Every plank laid and structure raised is a direct result of your hard labor. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/4df98e6610c469c7e769b209ed2a0f2c.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/4df98e6610c469c7e769b209ed2a0f2c.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/4df98e6610c469c7e769b209ed2a0f2c.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grease, Rust, and Roaring Engines<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machinery is the beating heart of your operation, but these iron beasts need constant babysitting. Listen to the rhythm of the pumps, replace grinding gears, and fight off the ever-present rust. If you don't maintain your equipment, the elements will gladly take it back.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/257d800119ce2cf7d46c0738862653af.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/257d800119ce2cf7d46c0738862653af.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/257d800119ce2cf7d46c0738862653af.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Crew, Your Lifeline<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't drain the earth dry on your own. Hire a rugged crew to handle the heavy lifting. Train your workers to boost efficiency, and don't forget to upgrade your home base. Better living conditions mean higher morale, unlocking new ways to streamline your growing business. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1792414442\" width=800 height=15 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9c880dd62a4fdb23e3d2cd32239add67.poster.avif?t=1792414442\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9c880dd62a4fdb23e3d2cd32239add67.webm?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/extras\/9c880dd62a4fdb23e3d2cd32239add67.mp4?t=1792414442\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strike It Rich<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling that first barrel of crude changes everything. Watch your funds skyrocket and immediately reinvest. Research early 1900s tech, expand your drilling territory, and replace rusty valves with industrial marvels. The race for wealth is unforgiving, but the payoff is legendary.<\/p>","short_description":"Step into the grit of the early 20th-century oil boom. Build your drilling empire from the dirt up chop timber, maintain rusty machinery, and manage a rugged crew. Strike black gold, overcome ruthless crises, and turn raw earth into an unimaginable fortune. The rush begins now.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hungarian<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/e405ba031c525651d7aad0b0218cb2cc7cb1509f\/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1792414442","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/2e243119ffcfd6d21f078c03bbd86177c9c50b22\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1792414442","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1473260\/2e243119ffcfd6d21f078c03bbd86177c9c50b22\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1792414442","website":"https:\/\/www.creativeforge.pl\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 64 Bit \/ Windows 8 64 Bit \/ Windows 10 64 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2100 \/ AMD Phenom II X4 965<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 550 Ti \/ I